WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.017
(mysterious noises)

00:00:04.017 --> 00:00:05.863
Male 1: If I told you about her

00:00:06.628 --> 00:00:08.491
M1: the princess without voice

00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:10.935
M1: what would I say?

00:00:11.954 --> 00:00:16.041
(enter reserved music)
(ringing bell gradually grows louder)

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:17.050
(click as an alarm is shut off)

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.951
(sounds occur in time with the music)

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:20.446
Female 1: Eliza! Come on!

00:00:20.446 --> 00:00:25.754
(sounds occur in time with the music)

00:00:25.754 --> 00:00:27.204
F1: Eliza, hurry, hurry

00:00:27.208 --> 00:00:31.848
(sounds occur in time with the music)

00:00:33.224 --> 00:00:35.263
(loud bang)
(music immediately stops)

00:00:35.514 --> 00:00:37.254
(soft bells begin playing)

00:00:37.273 --> 00:00:38.483
Male 2: She deaf?

00:00:38.483 --> 00:00:40.723
F1: Mute, sir; She can hear you.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.318
M2 (sternly): You clean that lab, you get out.

00:00:43.432 --> 00:00:45.340
(low drum hit as the screen cuts to black)

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:46.218
(water bubbling)

00:00:46.218 --> 00:00:47.566
Male 3: This may very well be

00:00:47.566 --> 00:00:49.516
M3: the most sensitive asset

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.216
M3: ever to be housed in this facility

00:00:51.491 --> 00:00:53.951
(orchestra hit at scene change)

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.073
M2: You may think

00:00:55.076 --> 00:00:56.256
M2: that thing looks human

00:00:56.621 --> 00:00:57.841
M2: ...stands on 2 legs, right?

00:00:57.841 --> 00:00:58.741
(water bubbles)

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.110
M2: ...but, we're created in the Lord's image

00:01:01.605 --> 00:01:02.405
M2: You don't think that's what the

00:01:02.405 --> 00:01:03.825
M2: the lord looks like, do-ya? [do you?]

00:01:04.055 --> 00:01:06.055
Male 4: This creature is intelligent,

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:07.610
M4: capable of language,

00:01:08.466 --> 00:01:10.406
M4: of understanding emotions.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.740
(music suddenly fades)

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.470
(pleasant music plays)

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.659
(music begins to fade)

00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:22.047
Male 5 (translating): "When he looks at me,"

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:23.827
M5: "he does not know"..."how"...

00:01:24.143 --> 00:01:25.438
M5: ..."I am incomplete."

00:01:25.438 --> 00:01:26.233
M5: "He"...

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:27.363
M5: ..."sees me"...

00:01:27.363 --> 00:01:28.312
(pleasant music resumes)

00:01:28.312 --> 00:01:29.292
M5: ..."as I am."

00:01:32.895 --> 00:01:36.755
(French vocals join music)

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.924
(light splashing noises)

00:01:42.004 --> 00:01:43.664
M2: The natives in the Amazon

00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:44.424
M2: worshipped 'em, [them,]--

00:01:44.424 --> 00:01:45.084
--(loud noise)--

00:01:45.099 --> 00:01:45.891
M2: ...like a god.

00:01:45.891 --> 00:01:47.651
(screeching noises)

00:01:48.106 --> 00:01:48.848
M5: "Get him out"...

00:01:48.848 --> 00:01:50.188
M5: What are you talking about?

00:01:50.344 --> 00:01:50.989
M5: No! (disturbed chuckle)

00:01:51.289 --> 00:01:51.689
(noise hit)

00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:52.839
M2: We need to take it apart;

00:01:53.161 --> 00:01:53.824
M2: Learn how it works.

00:01:53.824 --> 00:01:55.626
(French vocals continue, mysteriously)

00:01:55.626 --> 00:01:57.032
Male (apprehensive): I don't want an intricate,

00:01:57.032 --> 00:01:58.592
Male: beautiful thing destroyed!

00:01:59.198 --> 00:02:00.158
Other Male: We can do nothing!

00:02:00.159 --> 00:02:00.871
Other Male: I'm sorry!

00:02:00.871 --> 00:02:01.371
(drum hit)

00:02:01.373 --> 00:02:02.413
F1: Don't do this, Eliza.

00:02:02.619 --> 00:02:04.093
M2: What is she saying?!

00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:04.442
(crash)

00:02:04.442 --> 00:02:05.142
F1: Don't do this!

00:02:05.148 --> 00:02:06.488
(noise builds)

00:02:06.488 --> 00:02:08.007
M5 (gasping): It's not even human.

00:02:08.012 --> 00:02:09.555
(loud orchestra hit)

00:02:09.555 --> 00:02:11.195
(noise fades)

00:02:11.195 --> 00:02:13.579
(silence and running water)

00:02:13.579 --> 00:02:15.831
(underwater sounds)

00:02:15.831 --> 00:02:17.251
M1: If I told you about her...

00:02:18.251 --> 00:02:20.349
M1: ...what would I say? ...I wonder.

00:02:20.349 --> 00:02:24.449
(French vocals and music return)

00:02:27.148 --> 00:02:29.568
(music fades)

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.720
(silence)

